{
  "_about": "How documents are filed, labelled, cited and browsed. docTypes (sorted by name): titleLabel = cited and listed title-first, and the registry files these docs under a {year}/ folder (src/main/lib/registry.js); nonLineage = not part of an edition lineage, so citations carry authors, publisher and year. contentTypes (sorted by name): label = display name; noPage = no rendered doc page and not in the browse/search index. facets: the hand-curated keyword chips on the doc list (add/remove, and minDocs for the automatic ones). Citation templates are Handlebars files in src/main/templates/citations/<style>.<variant>.hbs. Read through src/main/lib/docRendering.js (loadDocRendering).",
